Ray Cromwell writes:

(quoting Harry)

> > MacWeek reports the slate will cost about $1200 and be available in
> > Oct 1994.
> 
>   At that price, you may as well go with AT&T's EO. The EO has higher
> resolution, more memory, a harddrive, a cellular phone, and a better
